  "cooked": "<p>There seems to have been a small mass-broadcast event a few hours ago. Here are some observations:</p>\n<p>On <code>bob</code>, running <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#34628</span> with default <code>txsendrate</code>, the inv-to-send queues stayed a lot smaller. This is expected as we drain the per-peer queue immediately with 34628.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/74e826abcad17943ade838d6156b5321c5e7f6f2.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/74e826abcad17943ade838d6156b5321c5e7f6f2\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/74e826abcad17943ade838d6156b5321c5e7f6f2_2_680x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"gGcLBTfXiwRqjPsUgVSMhKXD8R4\" width=\"680\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/74e826abcad17943ade838d6156b5321c5e7f6f2_2_680x500.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/74e826abcad17943ade838d6156b5321c5e7f6f2.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/74e826abcad17943ade838d6156b5321c5e7f6f2.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"171718\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">836\u00d7614 88 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>On <code>bob</code>, we spend a lot less time in the <code>b-msghand</code> thread:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/7d61c26c961900032b8a962e6ea29086c5161cec.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/7d61c26c961900032b8a962e6ea29086c5161cec\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/7d61c26c961900032b8a962e6ea29086c5161cec_2_690x254.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"hTb8dlfWEGbZHxGk0yGvofYk908\" width=\"690\" height=\"254\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/7d61c26c961900032b8a962e6ea29086c5161cec_2_690x254.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/7d61c26c961900032b8a962e6ea29086c5161cec.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/7d61c26c961900032b8a962e6ea29086c5161cec.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"908359\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">836\u00d7308 42.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>And the response time for a localhost <code>ping</code> didn\u2019t increase for <code>bob</code>, while it did for the other nodes.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/654127fe5799f79ea49ebbc75eaee56895a37052.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/654127fe5799f79ea49ebbc75eaee56895a37052\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/654127fe5799f79ea49ebbc75eaee56895a37052_2_690x345.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"erJOUf3QxYeuSfqeG4RIqCbzzCW\" width=\"690\" height=\"345\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/654127fe5799f79ea49ebbc75eaee56895a37052_2_690x345.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/654127fe5799f79ea49ebbc75eaee56895a37052_2_1035x517.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/654127fe5799f79ea49ebbc75eaee56895a37052.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"121315\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1215\u00d7609 123 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>The INVs sent by <code>bob</code> were larger than the ones by the other nodes. With 34628, we fully drain the per-peer queue, so INVs can be larger than before, were we capped it at 70 (unless the queue got large).</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/c206236a19c365f30cd805084f0c788c6d90733d.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/c206236a19c365f30cd805084f0c788c6d90733d\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/c206236a19c365f30cd805084f0c788c6d90733d_2_690x340.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"rGpMoBEkkf0SYeF4OeKUbWYZrel\" width=\"690\" height=\"340\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/c206236a19c365f30cd805084f0c788c6d90733d_2_690x340.jpeg, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/c206236a19c365f30cd805084f0c788c6d90733d_2_1035x510.jpeg 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/c206236a19c365f30cd805084f0c788c6d90733d.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1C1B1A\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1111\u00d7548 122 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
